00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:50.560
K I R I O U S -


00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:50.640
K I R I O U S


00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:50.760
K I R I O U


00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:50.840
K I R I O


00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:50.960
